{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14215350","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14215350","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:4:1421535001:1":{"text":"耶！满满赢了！瓦恩是冠军！","source_cn":"耶！满满赢了！瓦恩是冠军！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE236394F593B29C5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1421535002:1":{"text":"我是……冠军……锻魂大赛的冠军……我想都不敢想……","source_cn":"我是……冠军……锻魂大赛的冠军……我想都不敢想……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x946BEACB6AE0AAE3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1421535003:1":{"text":"瓦恩……虽然满满还是最喜欢自己的剑，但刚刚战斗的时候，你锻造的那把剑对满满来说，就是最完美的武器！","source_cn":"瓦恩……虽然满满还是最喜欢自己的剑，但刚刚战斗的时候，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB1C58F95F90E5DAE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1421535004:1":{"text":"谢谢你们……谢谢我的两位师父和漫漫的帮助！","source_cn":"谢谢你们……谢谢我的两位师父和漫漫的帮助！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x783D21F1E02D9187","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1421535005:1":{"text":"一直以来，我都在追寻技艺的极致，想用这双手锻造出世界上最完美的武器……我对锻造出的作品的期望越来越高，高到它快把我压垮了！","source_cn":"一直以来，我都在追寻技艺的极致，想用这双手锻造出世界上...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0DF899C680028D4E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","d